# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

boundaries is project
boundaries purpose "Print comparisons, logic, and arithmetic at their boundaries; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
boundaries target console
boundaries version "0.1.0"
boundaries language refined 1
boundaries standardLibrary 1
boundaries allows write console.stdout none
boundaries requires none
boundaries includesModule boundaries
boundaries entry boundaries.main
